 rplant project is ever evolving - after the lo-fi synth-punk of 2019’s b
 reakout debut album\, People in the Sun came an instrumental 2022 dungeon-
 synth release Stump Soup. The kaleidoscopic Grass EP (2023) was followed b
 y last year’s 80’s rock explorations on the moody Crashing Cars 7” a
 nd the 
