DTSTAMP:20260926T045037Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T100000
SUMMARY:The Morning Read
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**The Morning Read: "Can I afford to … ?
 "**\n\n...Hire? ....Buy the second van? ....Take the bigger space? ....Rai
 se prices? ....Finally pay myself?\n\nIt's the most common question owners
  ask\, and it almost never gets answered — because "afford" isn't a feel
 ing and it isn't the bank balance. It's a number\, and it isn't on your P&
 L.\n\nThis session is about learning how to find it. If you're a business 
 owner trying to figure out whether you can afford your next move\, or a fi
 nancial professional with a few tricks up your sleeve for helping folks fi
 nd the answer faster — come. We'll walk through the numbers that help wi
 th decisions. Not so you walk out with one answer — so the next time the
  question comes up\, you know how to answer it yourself.\n\nReal numbers f
 rom real books\, read out loud — like reading tea leaves\, except it's m
 ath. For owners\, buyers\, and the people who advise them. No accounting b
 ackground required.\n\nMonday\, September 28 · 9–10 AM\nHosted by: Seve
 n Acres\, [105 Fairview Rd\, Asheville](https://www.google.com/maps/search
 /105+Fairview+Rd\,+Asheville?entry=gmail&source=g) · Free\, coffee's on\n
 Sponsored by: [Aktiga](https://aktiga.com)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316556119/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260914T171706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260914T171706Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
