BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Devilsfootbrew": "https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/a-call-to-action/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:devilsfootbrew
X-SOURCE:The Mule at Devils Foot
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T190000
DTSTAMP:20260926T005110
CREATED:20260908T152345Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T190741Z
UID:10001889-1790787600-1790794800@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:A Call to Action with The Conservation Alliance
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Mule for an evening built around community and connection\, celebrating the people and organizations working to protect the land\, water\, and wildlife we all care about. That same week\, outdoor industry and media professionals will be gathering in Asheville for the Outdoor Media Summit so we wanted to bring that same energy to all of you\, celebrating the people and organizations working to protect the land\, water\, and wildlife we all care about.Local and regional nonprofits will have tables set up around the taproom\, so you can walk around\, ask questions\, and talk directly with the people doing this work. Come learn how to support parks\, forests\, and the places you love. \nThe evening also coincides with the Outdoor Media Summit\, bringing outdoor industry and media professionals to Asheville that same week — a great time to bring our own community together around the same spirit. \nA portion of the evening’s proceeds will support conservation efforts in our region. \nOrganizations joining us include The Conservation Alliance\, National Parks Conservation Association\, The Wilderness Society\, Defenders of Wildlife\, MountainTrue\, GreenWorks\, and Outdoor Business Alliance. \n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/a-call-to-action/
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Free & Fun!,Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/1The-Conservation-Alliance-Community-Flyer.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=a7eb88ccf77ad5f711faf96138cd71a2
END:VEVENT
