BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ashevilleart": "https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/live-music-meschiya-lake/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ashevilleart
X-SOURCE:Asheville Art Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T203000
DTSTAMP:20260923T202605Z
CREATED:20260817T150636Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T202605Z
UID:10007625-1790879400-1790886600@www.ashevilleart.org
SUMMARY:Live Music | Meschiya Lake
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of lush\, intimate sound comprised of stringed instruments\, vocal harmonies\, and original compositions featuring local musician Meschiya Lake.  \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN  \nMeschiya Lake is a dynamic addition to Asheville’s music scene\, bringing her powerful vocals\, captivating stage presence\, and genre-spanning sound to audiences across Western North Carolina. After years of building an acclaimed career in New Orleans\, Lake has made Asheville home\, blending jazz\, blues\, Americana\, and country influences into performances that are both timeless and fresh. Whether performing intimate originals or beloved classics\, Meschiya’s heartfelt storytelling and infectious energy continue to win over local music lovers throughout the region.  \nFrom the stages of Lincoln Center in New York City\, to Brazil\, Canada\, Denmark\, The Netherlands\, Italy\, Russia\, the United Kingdom\, and Ireland\, Meschiya Lake has shown people to express love of life through music and dance.  This passion\, seemingly tireless energy\, and expert skill have garnered much praise\, from NPR’s top ten albums of 2010 to First Lady of Jazz 2013\, at the Sun Valley Jazz Festival. But most importantly\, back at home in New Orleans\, Lake was recognized as Female Performer of the Year\, three years running\, at the Big Easy Awards\, and named Best Female Singer in Offbeat Magazine’s Best of the Beat poll in 2013 and 2014.  \nFor more information on Meschiya Lake please visit  www.meschiyalake.com \nPurchase Tickets\n 
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/live-music-meschiya-lake/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Performance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/meschiya-press-1-lg.webp
GEO:35.5946714;-82.5512827
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Asheville Art Museum 2 South Pack Square Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2 South Pack Square:geo:-82.5512827,35.5946714
END:VEVENT
