 he dramatic AIM away messages\, the MySpace profiles and the crippling bel
 ief that nobody understood them. It’s time to dust off your old band tee
 s and see if all of those years of emotionally devastating yourself to mus
 ic actually paid off. Join us at Eulogy for a night of angsty anthems sure
  to challenge your emo credentials with our very own badass emo girl Bree 
LOCATION:Eulogy\, 10 Buxton Avenue\, Asheville\, North Carolina 28801\, Un
 ited States
URL:https://link.dice.fm/Hd9fb479ffd0
