DESCRIPTION:Richmond\, Virginia songwriter **Wes Parker** blends indie roc
 k\, Americana\, and alt-country with melodic pop hooks rounded out with gr
 unge textured guitar. Formerly of Camp Howard\, he later gained a large on
 line following through his satirical crust punk character\, Skunk. His sel
 f produced debut solo album\, \\*Super Rare\\*\, was released in 2026 thro
 ugh Big Machine Rock.
