X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville Writers": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-writers/events/phwgztyjcnbcc/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_writers
X-SOURCE:AVL Writers
UID:event_phwgztyjcnbcc@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045038Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T200000
SUMMARY:Weekly Critique
DESCRIPTION:AVL Writers\nThis is the standing weekly critique. Bring anyth
 ing new you're working on to share with the group. If you don't have a pro
 ject to share\, you are most welcome to attend\, discuss\, and get inspire
 d.\n\nFor our group discussion\, please bring at least 8-10 printed copies
  of your piece. That way\, we can all read through each other's work and p
 rovide feedback.\n\nSharing our creative efforts is an important part of t
 he writing process. I'm really looking forward to reading what you've been
  working on. Don't worry if it's still a rough draft.\n\nIf you're having 
 trouble finding us\, look for a placard on the table with the group's name
 .\n\nIf you would like to join our group email list for updates regarding 
 contests\, events\, and more [you can sign up on our website](https://avlw
 riters.com/).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-writers/events/phwgztyjcnbcc/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260709T180135Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260709T180135Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup She Owns It Avl": "https://www.meetup.com/she-owns-it-avl/events/316699271/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_she_owns_it_avl
X-SOURCE:She Owns It AVL
UID:event_316699271@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045107Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T200000
SUMMARY:✨ She Owns It AVL ✨
DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n**✨** **She Owns It AVL Meetup✨**\n
 \n**October Featured Guest:**\n**Palveshey**\, also known as **Naga Das\,*
 * is the **founder of Alternative Coaching Methods** and author of the new
 ly released *Dying to Live*.\n\nHer journey has taken her through AI resea
 rch\, finance\, academia\, and entrepreneurship to work centered on transf
 ormation\, purpose\, and consciousness.\n\nPalveshey will share her story
 —the unexpected turns that reshaped her life\, challenged what she belie
 ved about success and identity\, and ultimately led her to where she is to
 day.\n\nCome hear her story and join us for an evening of connection\, con
 versation\, and community💛\n\n**We can’t wait to see you! 💫**\n**D
 oors open at 5:30**\n\n**We’re so grateful for everyone who signs up to 
 join us! If your plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it helps us plan 
 and opens a space for another woman to attend.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/she-owns-it-avl/events/316699271/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260924T201553Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T201553Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
