DESCRIPTION:Your Yoga is offered Mondays and Wednesdays at 10 am. The prac
 tice is led by Wendy Lantis\, E-RYT\, who has been teaching for 20+ years.
  This light-hearted\, accessible practice is open to everyone. Modificatio
 ns are offered to make the practice fit your own individual needs each tim
 e you come to the mat. Please bring your own yoga mat and a small blanket 
 to sit on and use under your knees. A few blankets and blocks available\, 
 but always a good idea to bring any props you may need to make your prac
