X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville Classic Books Meetup Group": "https://www.meetup.com/asheville-classic-books-meetup-group/events/316083208/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_classic_books_meetup_group
X-SOURCE:Books That Age Like Wine
UID:event_316083208@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045039Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T203000
SUMMARY:A Connecticut Yankee in King Arthur’s Court - Mark Twain
DESCRIPTION:Books That Age Like Wine\n**Mark Twain moves from broad comedy
  to biting social satire in this literary classic.**\n\n**Cracked on the h
 ead by a crowbar in nineteenth-century Connecticut\, Hank Morgan wakes to 
 find himself in King Arthur’s England. After using his knoweldge of an u
 pcoming solar eclipse to escape a death sentence\, Hank must then navigate
  his way through a medieval world whose idyllic surface masks fear\, injus
 tice\, and ignorance.**\n\n**Considered by H. L. Mencken to be “the most
  bitter critic of American platitude and delusion…that ever lived\,” T
 wain enchants readers with a Camelot that strikes disturbingly contemporar
 y notes in this acclaimed tour de force that encompasses both the pure joy
  of wild high jinks and deeply probing insights into the nature of man.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-classic-books-meetup-group/
 events/316083208/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T102621Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T102621Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
