DESCRIPTION:CALLING ALL WORDSMITH’S : 2nd Thursday of the MonthA brand-n
 ew writing class is taking shape\, and you’re invited to be part of the 
 story!Hosted by In Other Words—a collective of local writers and perform
 ers—this group welcomes all genres: fiction\, nonfiction\, poetry\, essa
 ys\, lyrics\, playwriting\, and whatever else flows from your pen. We’ll
